#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:5
msgid "Element numbering"
msgstr "元素编号"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows an automatic codification of `elements`_. This feature "
"is useful for the creation of reports, `Bill of Materials (BOM)`_, and for "
"the identification of devices at the physical installation and schemas."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许自动编译 `元件 <elements_>`_。这个特性对于创建报告 `Bill of Materials(BOM) "
"<Bill of Materials (BOM)_>`_，以及对于在物理安装和计划上识别设备都是有益的。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:11
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows defining multiples auto numbering patterns. It also "
"provides many flexibility on the creation of auto numbering pattern using "
"text, variables and sequential numbers."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许定义多重的汽车编号模式，它也为使用文本，变量和顺序编号创建汽车编号模式提供了许多灵活性。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:17
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element auto numbering"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech元素自动编号"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:19
msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst
#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:22
msgid "X"
msgstr "X"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst
#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:22
msgid "AAAA"
msgstr "亚行"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:26
msgid "Code defined by `IEC 81346`_ norm."
msgstr "由 `IEC 81346 <IEC 81346_>`_ 规范定义的代码。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:28
msgid "**A**: Two or more purposes or tasks."
msgstr "**A**:两个或两个以上的目的或任务。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:29
msgid ""
"**B**: Converting an input variable into a signal for further processing."
msgstr "**B**:将一个输入变量转换成信号供进一步处理。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:30
msgid "**C**: Storing of energy, information or material."
msgstr "**C**:储存能量，信息或材料。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:31
msgid "**E**: Providing radiant or thermal energy."
msgstr "**E**:提供光电或热能。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:32
msgid "**F**: Direct protection from dangerous or unwanted conditions."
msgstr "**F**:直接保护免受危险或不想要的条件。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:33
msgid "**G**: Initiating a flow of energy or material."
msgstr "**G**:启动能量或材料流。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:34
msgid "**H**: Producing a new kind of material or product."
msgstr "**H**:生产新型材料或产品。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:35
msgid "**K**: Processing signals or information."
msgstr "**K**:处理信号或信息。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:36
msgid "**M**: Providing mechanical energy for driving purposes."
msgstr "**M**:为驾驶目的提供机械能量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:37
msgid "**P**: Presenting information."
msgstr "**P**:介绍情况。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Q**: Controlled switching or varying a flow of energy, of signals or of "
"material."
msgstr "**Q**:控制下的转换或改变能量、信号或材料的流动。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:39
msgid ""
"**R**: Restricting or stabilizing motion or a flow of energy or material."
msgstr "**R**:限制或稳定运动或能量或材料的流动。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:40
msgid ""
"**S**: Converting a manual operation into a signal for further processing."
msgstr "**S**:将人工操作转换成信号供进一步处理。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:41
msgid "**T**: Conversion of energy maintaining the kind of energy."
msgstr "**T**:能量转换维持能量类型。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:42
msgid "**U**: Keeping objects in a defined position."
msgstr "**U**:将对象保留在定义的位置。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:43
msgid "**V**: Processing (treating) of material or products."
msgstr "**V**:材料或产品的加工(处理)."

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:44
msgid "**W**: Guiding or transporting from one place to another."
msgstr "**W**:指导或从一个地方运送到另一个地方。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:45
msgid "**X**: Connecting objects"
msgstr "**X**:连接对象"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:48
msgid "Alphanumeric code which identify the element."
msgstr "识别元素的字母代码 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:52
msgid ""
"For more information about how to define auto numbering patterns, refer to "
"`project auto numbering properties`_ section."
msgstr ""
"有关如何定义自动编号模式的更多信息，请参见 `项目自动编号属性 <project auto numbering properties_>`_ 节。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_numbering.rst:54
msgid ""
"For more information about how to manage the codification of conductors, "
"refer to `add element`_ section."
msgstr "关于如何管理导体编纂的更多信息，请参见 `添加元素 <add element_>`_ 部分。"
